course: dictionary
lesson: 8055
title: Believing in rebirth
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Long words can look scary, but context helps. In «Hindus believe the soul is reborn many times (reincarnation) until it reaches freedom», the word reborn is a clue. Reincarnation is about being born again.
explain: Reincarnation is a belief: after a person or animal dies, their soul is born again in a new body. Read «Hindus believe in reincarnation: the soul is reborn in a new body until it is finally freed» and check the meaning by swapping in «being born again».
explain: The same word can mean more than one thing. You might hear someone say an old song is a reincarnation of a classic, which means a new version of an old thing. Always check which meaning fits the sentence you are reading.
fact: Reincarnation means the belief that a soul is born again in a new body after death.
fact: Hinduism, Buddhism and Sikhism include the belief in reincarnation.
fact: Christians believe in resurrection and eternal life, not reincarnation.
fact: In some stories and films, characters claim to remember a past life.
fact: Informally, a reincarnation can be a new version of an old thing.
exercise: «Hindus believe the soul is reborn many times.» What does reincarnation mean here? | *The soul is born again in a new body | The soul is a kind of weather | The soul stays in the same body forever | The soul turns into a song
exercise: Which word in «Hindus believe in reincarnation: the soul is reborn in a new body until it is finally freed» tells you the meaning? | finally | *reborn | believe | freed
exercise: Christians believe in resurrection and eternal life. Which belief is NOT the Christian one? | Eternal life | *Reincarnation | Hope of heaven | Resurrection
test: Informally, what can a reincarnation be? | A type of bird | *A new version of an old thing | Part of a sentence | The end of a story
test: «She believes she remembers a past life.» What is a past life? | *A life lived before this one | A very long holiday | A book about history | A life she is living now
exam: Which sentence best explains reincarnation? | A cat sleeps all day in the sun | A river flows into the sea | *After death, the soul is born again in a new body | People sing songs at a festival
